# autorhythm: the TR-77's 6/8 MARCH, chosen because it is the rhythm that PROVES the
# hatching. Its counter steps OVER four of its sixteen columns, so the panel reads
# "steps 12 of 16 (hatched)" and the skipped states are drawn as struck-through ticks.
# Machine 1 (]), then RIGHT five times to reach it, then run.
tap 20 ]
tap 35 RIGHT
tap 45 RIGHT
tap 55 RIGHT
tap 65 RIGHT
tap 75 RIGHT
tap 90 SPACE
